'''Blue Strike''' (ブルーパワー, ''Burū Pawā'', '''Blue Power''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

==Effect==
Research Power UP (XL): [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers']] recharge times are reduced by 131 (?) frames (4.37 (?) sec).

